# OpenClaw

## AI-Powered Project Operations & Document Intelligence

OpenClaw is an AI-assisted project operations and document intelligence platform for engineering teams.

Built with **FastAPI + React/Vite** and powered by **Mistral AI**, OpenClaw demonstrates how AI, continuous monitoring, document intelligence, and workflow automation can reduce repetitive project-management activities and surface issues requiring human attention.

The platform is designed as a **working proof of concept (PoC)** that can evolve into an enterprise automation solution through integration with existing project-management, collaboration, document, security, and business systems.

---

## 1. The Business Problem

Project and engineering teams often spend significant time manually:

- Collecting team status updates
- Monitoring sprint progress
- Identifying project risks
- Following up on stale or overdue updates
- Preparing management reports
- Searching across project documentation
- Reviewing requirements and design documents
- Identifying complexity and potential delivery concerns
- Triggering repetitive project-management workflows

OpenClaw demonstrates an alternative approach:

> **Continuously monitor available project information, use AI to analyse it, identify items requiring attention, and automate appropriate follow-up workflows.**

The goal is not to remove the project manager from the process.

The goal is to allow project managers to spend less time collecting and processing information and more time making decisions.

