## 8. Request Flow

1. React SPA authenticates using JWT.
2. Subsequent API requests include a bearer token in the Authorization header.
3. FastAPI validates the authentication token.
4. Requests are dispatched to the appropriate API router.
5. AI/search operations use Mistral and ChromaDB.
6. Background workers run independently of HTTP requests.
7. Scheduled workers evaluate project conditions and trigger configured workflows.

