## 23. Network Server

To make the backend available to other machines:

```bash
uvicorn backend.main:app \
  --reload \
  --host 0.0.0.0 \
  --port 8000
```

Configure the frontend development server:

```javascript
server: {
  host: "0.0.0.0",
  port: 3000,
  proxy: {
    "/api": "http://localhost:8000"
  }
}
```

Run:

```bash
npm run dev -- --host 0.0.0.0
```

Find the server IP:

```bash
ip addr show eth0
```

Other machines can then connect to:

```text
http://<server-ip>:3000
```

