## 24. WSL on Windows

If running the application inside WSL, Windows port forwarding can be configured from an elevated PowerShell session.

Replace `<WSL_IP>` with the WSL interface address:

```powershell
netsh interface portproxy add v4tov4 `
  listenport=3000 `
  listenaddress=0.0.0.0 `
  connectport=3000 `
  connectaddress=<WSL_IP>

netsh interface portproxy add v4tov4 `
  listenport=8000 `
  listenaddress=0.0.0.0 `
  connectport=8000 `
  connectaddress=<WSL_IP>
```

To remove the forwarding:

```powershell
netsh interface portproxy delete v4tov4 `
  listenport=3000 `
  listenaddress=0.0.0.0

netsh interface portproxy delete v4tov4 `
  listenport=8000 `
  listenaddress=0.0.0.0
```

