## 28. Project Positioning

OpenClaw should be viewed as a **technical demonstration of an AI-powered project-operations automation approach**, rather than as a replacement for existing enterprise project-management platforms.

Its purpose is to demonstrate how an organisation can introduce an intelligent automation layer around existing processes and systems.

The underlying concept is:

```text
Existing Enterprise Systems
            ↓
       Data / Events
            ↓
    AI + Automation Layer
            ↓
    Analysis / Decisions
            ↓
 Human Review Where Needed
            ↓
       Automated Action
            ↓
